🎓 CampusCare – College Complaint Management System

CampusCare is a web-based College Complaint Management System designed to make the complaint management process easier, faster, and more organized for students and college administrators.

Students can register, submit complaints, and track their complaint status, while administrators can monitor and manage complaints through a dedicated Admin Dashboard.

🚀 Project Overview

CampusCare provides a digital platform where students can report college-related issues such as classroom problems, library facilities, hostel issues, canteen services, computer labs, electrical problems, and sanitation.

The system helps improve communication between students and college administration.

✨ Features

👨‍🎓 Student Module

- Student Registration and Login
- Student Dashboard
- Submit New Complaints
- Select Complaint Category
- Set Complaint Priority
- Track Complaint Status
- View Complaint History
- View Complaint Statistics

🛡️ Admin Module

- Admin Login
- Admin Dashboard
- View Total Registered Students
- View All Student Complaints
- Monitor Pending, In Progress, and Resolved Complaints
- Search Complaints
- Filter Complaints by Category
- Filter Complaints by Status
- Filter Complaints by Priority
- Reset Search and Filters

🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5 – Website Structure
- CSS3 – Styling and Responsive Design
- JavaScript – Functionality and Dynamic Operations
- LocalStorage – Browser-Based Data Storage
- Font Awesome – Icons
- Google Fonts – Typography

