💻 How to Run the Project

1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Open "index.html" in your browser.
4. Register as a student and log in.
5. Explore the complaint submission and tracking features.
6. Access the Admin Module using the configured admin credentials.

📌 Current Project Status

- Student Registration and Login
- Complaint Submission
- Complaint Tracking
- Admin Dashboard
- Search and Filter Functionality
- Responsive User Interface

Note: This version uses browser LocalStorage for data storage. Data is browser-specific and is not automatically shared between different devices. A shared backend and database are required for a fully connected production system.

